Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:09.17,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Until I can reach the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:15.71,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I believe, until the next tomorrow, hey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:35.55,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Chasing and being chased on top of Mobius' ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:39.35,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Getting closer and facing forward, hey I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:43.45,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It begins, it expands, this flavor that exceeds imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:47.76,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I feel so good throughout my body, I will become free, oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.79,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if it's far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.73,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, by telling each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.60,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Share the good times and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:01:03.74,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going until I can reach the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:13.05,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's overcome it now, I believe in the next tomorrow yeah yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:21.56,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,You were waiting there on the other side of the invisible wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:31.62,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon, I believe in one world yeah yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:51.29,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\fad(550,55}黃猿對決四位船長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:03.07,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,太不可思議了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.49,0:02:05.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,從手裡、嘴裡都能發射？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:06.29,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,好恐怖！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:09.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,又來了一發！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那到底是什麼玩意？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:26.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,像他們說的，是光束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.79,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,光束不就是光線嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:30.83,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把那種東西當武器用簡直是幻想！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:33.63,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,呃，你在幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:35.81,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,裝死。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:38.17,Main,Franky & Usopp,0,0,0,,他已經知道你沒死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:48.48,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三刀流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.53,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:52.57,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔風
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:54.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}羊肉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:54.81,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}羊肉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:55.85,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.11,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}六百煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.43,Main,All,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大砲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:17.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,打中了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.25,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他們好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:21.15,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,對手是七武海。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:23.59,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不可能那麼容易打倒的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.91,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,從他們的表情就看得出來。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他真的那麼不同嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:33.55,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,難道說他是雙胞胎之類的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:37.27,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,嗯，那是有可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:43.70,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,反正如果是真的那傢伙，他早就閃開我們的攻擊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:48.11,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,更重要的是，他沒有發射衝擊波，也沒有肉球。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:52.44,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,但如果他是冒牌的，那也是個問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.98,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那就意味著有兩個跟他一樣強的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:12.47,Main,Urouge,0,0,0,,你把我打得很慘...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.99,Main,Urouge,0,0,0,,但別以為我跟剛才一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.60,Main,Urouge,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}因果報應
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.65,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,「怪僧」烏魯基...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:41.33,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,一個剛才還傷痕累累的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:45.41,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,怎麼突然變得這麼大這麼強了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:00.17,Main,Drake,0,0,0,,那是黃猿的鐳射！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:06.63,Thoughts,Drake,0,0,0,,你把黃猿的破壞力裝進了乂索隆熊的身體裡嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.05,Thoughts,Drake,0,0,0,,乂乂乂克博士？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:13.09,Thoughts,Drake,0,0,0,,和平主義者已經進化到這種程度了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:17.83,Main,Pirate 1,0,0,0,,事態失控了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:20.75,Main,Pirate 2,0,0,0,,對啊，就算是三個超過一億的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:23.99,Main,Pirate 2,0,0,0,,面對七武海和大將也不可能活下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.73,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,前少將乂雷克...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:34.03,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,不，前少將...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:37.11,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你不就是來看這場好戲的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.78,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,想打的話儘管上。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:44.53,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,既然你已經知道內情了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:47.28,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我猜你只是怕得不敢動吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.11,0:05:54.33,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,不過你們這些脆弱的小鬼別太慌張。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:01.79,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,畢竟我也在呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:26.01,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,嗯，又讓我看到了有趣的東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:30.67,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,這是我第一次看到稀有的古代種動物系能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:04.25,Main,Drake,0,0,0,,沒想到你的血管裡也流著紅色的血。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:10.07,Main,Urouge,0,0,0,,我剛看到了很不尋常的東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:14.11,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我都說了我也在這裡，聽不見嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:39.47,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,一個接一個...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:43.07,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你們這些超過一億的人果然都是怪物。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.74,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,真是可怕呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.09,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}降魔相
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:53.77,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,他消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:00.99,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我、我的眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:03.25,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,霍金斯船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:06.15,Main,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我看不見！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:14.71,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我不知道你擁有什麼能力，但你有實體...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:17.27,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,所以你不是自然系吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:25.75,Main,Pirate 1,0,0,0,,船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:26.75,Main,Pirate 2,0,0,0,,不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:28.37,Main,Pirate 2,0,0,0,,他已經超過了傷害上限！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:29.69,Main,Pirate 2,0,0,0,,他真的要死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.29,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,第一個...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:38.75,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你漫長的航程能走到這裡已經很不錯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.47,Lyrics,Apoo,0,0,0,,Is this music reachin' you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:19.01,Lyrics,Apoo,0,0,0,,If you hear me, then tune in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.79,Lyrics,Apoo,0,0,0,,Navy admiral Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.35,Main,Drake,0,0,0,,他是「海鳴」...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:36.83,Lyrics,Apoo,0,0,0,,Everybody, listen to my fighting music!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:50.83,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.61,Lyrics,Apoo,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:05.55,Lyrics,Apoo,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:19.19,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,不過，海軍大將應該不會被這種程度的攻擊殺死吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:22.47,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,哇，今天可真是看了不少有趣的東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.57,0:10:24.21,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,好了，我先撤了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:24.81,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,再見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:35.95,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,太慘了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:09.85,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,哎呀，嚇了我一跳...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:18.08,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}八咫鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:25.09,Main,Apoo,0,0,0,,嗯，什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.01,0:12:35.83,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:38.37,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:40.23,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:43.09,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢，在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.85,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我是波爾薩利諾。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:46.95,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,老頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:49.63,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你明明帶著幼年電話蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.57,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你怎麼不聯繫我？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.17,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢，戰桃丸君！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.33,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,別只說「噢」！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:57.67,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你在搞什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:59.77,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你已經到島上了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:03.53,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,嗯，聯絡不上你嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:07.87,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你又對著黑色電話蟲說話了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:13.33,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我跟你說過了，你手臂上的黑色電話蟲只能竊聽用！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:14.41,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:15.63,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢...！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:17.37,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:19.43,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,快點給我回去工作！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:21.57,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我們已經鎖定目標了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:27.41,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,草帽魯夫、乂德船長、和特拉法爾加·羅，你想先從誰開始？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:29.45,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢，是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:30.86,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,那麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.52,Captions,,0,890,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(0,20)}夏波帝諸島\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N12號紅樹林
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.04,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你真的傷重到動不了了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:51.40,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,別管他了魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:54.90,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我們得先打倒這個東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:09.68,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他之前的傷不可能完全痊癒...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:15.17,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,就我看來，光是站起來面對敵人就已經很痛苦了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:21.40,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果這傢伙不是乂索隆熊，那到底是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:24.71,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,長得跟七武海一模一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:27.71,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:36.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:41.52,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}刻蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.68,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}櫻花暴風雪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:45.74,Main,Luffy and Sanji,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:57.98,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}強力鐵鎚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.90,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}佛朗基拳擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:12.76,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}蜘蛛網
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:18.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他的物理力量也不能小看！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.10,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.78,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:27.80,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}燕子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:29.42,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}前方跳躍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:32.02,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,咦、咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:37.06,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我停下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:41.28,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,等、等等，那很危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:44.20,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你想殺了我嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:47.22,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,...雖然我已經死了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:49.56,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,等等，現在不是說這個的時候...！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺巨人甲蟲流星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:56.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在是機會！快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.88,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,好恐怖！太感謝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:09.82,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,嗯？他的動作怪怪的...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:15.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？現在炸彈對他有效了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:22.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有一發打進了他嘴裡... 他體內一定有什麼東西短路了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:27.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他的身體雖然堅硬，但裡面還是有血的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:31.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他跟我一樣，全身都被改造成了武器...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,但他本質上還是個普通人類！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.40,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美桑小心！他發現你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:45.82,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:47.34,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}八十輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:47.34,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}八十朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:48.90,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}四手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:48.90,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}四手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:50.84,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.06,0:16:57.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,成功了！他在自己嘴裡發射了光束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:58.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他自爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.48,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,抱歉打擾你休息了先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:10.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不過你在那裡得小心雷電喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:14.06,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,從烏雲引導到天候棒...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.40,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}雷霆槍騎兵節拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:30.22,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那一下肯定有效了... 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:42.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,完全沒效果吧？！他不是好端端的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:51.00,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,一旦慌了神，戰鬥就結束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:56.58,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，把他轟過來這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你還真是死倔...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:01.36,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔風腳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.22,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}燒烤射擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.22,Note,,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}火焰射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:13.14,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！他終於開始散架了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.10,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鬼氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.16,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}九刀流
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.24,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}阿修羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.74,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,什... 那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:22.96,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,索隆分身了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.54,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}九魔閃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:38.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,上吧魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.50,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,再來一擊就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.65,0:18:48.20,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:53.08,Main,Usopp and Chopper,0,0,0,,轟飛他，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:58.62,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨人來福槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:20.16,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我在縮小！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們把那傢伙搞定了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,應該是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:59.02,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,但他看起來好像隨時會再動起來... 好詭異...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:03.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果真動了我們就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.52,0:20:05.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我累壞了，動不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:09.16,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,也許我們應該逃跑而不是跟他打的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:13.20,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不，能打倒他就該打倒他。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:15.64,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不然他會一直追著我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:20.32,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不過那傢伙到底是什麼來歷？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他絕對是個改造人...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:29.82,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那就意味著他本來是個長得像乂索隆熊的人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:36.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我猜他們是雙胞胎，或者只是找到了一個長得超級像的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.50,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我覺得這是最合理的解釋。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:43.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,畢竟不可能真的造出一個人類來吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:48.76,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,PX-4？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:52.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們休息一下吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:56.72,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒想到這麼快就被逼到全力以赴了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:21:01.02,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我想休息，但我們應該先找個藏身處。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:05.30,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果現在被找到就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:07.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,說得也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:08.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:11.26,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,等一下，好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:16.88,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你們可真是搞了大事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？！又有敵人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:20.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那聲音從哪來的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:23.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,上面！他們在上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:35.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:39.74,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,喂喂！你可真慘啊PX-4！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:46.54,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,光是造你們一個和平主義者就花了跟整艘軍艦一樣多的錢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:52.50,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,該怎麼跟那個該死的龐克交代啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:56.27,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(700,300)}海軍本部\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N科學部隊隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:59.10,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(450,0)}戰桃丸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:08.16,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,又是七武海！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:10.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,難、難道那個是真的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:12.92,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不管是真的還是假的...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:17.74,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我們已經沒有力氣再對付那種東西了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:20.36,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他剛才說了「和平主義者」...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:24.56,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,「和平主義者」... 就是創造和平的人對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:28.46,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那是我們剛打倒的那個的名字嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:30.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你是誰，大斧頭？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:32.88,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,別用武器的名字叫人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:35.34,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,問我也沒用。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:38.26,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我什麼都不會告訴你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:41.16,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我可是世界上防守最嚴密的男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:43.76,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,當然我的嘴巴也守得很嚴！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:46.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你至少能告訴我們你的名字吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:49.24,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我沒有義務回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:55.42,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我不是剛說了嗎？我是全世界最守口如瓶的男人——戰桃丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,真的嗎？戰桃丸是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.98,0:23:03.58,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我只是想說而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.76,0:23:06.20,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我可不是在回答你的問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.02,0:23:09.30,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,走吧PX-1！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.04,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他從掌心也能發射光束...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:25.22,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,但他沒有肉球。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.56,0:23:28.54,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我本來不想相信，但那就是第三個了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:29.64,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:32.92,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,與其好奇那個，\N不如趕快逃跑比較安全！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:38.24,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,如果現在再打一場，肯定有人會死！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:40.70,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,趁還沒遇到大將趕快跑...！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:41.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:46.02,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,趕緊逃離這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.56,0:23:49.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們不能待在一起... 分頭逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:58.82,Main,Usopp and Chopper,0,0,0,,我覺得也該跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:01.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們三個分開！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:04.22,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,好... 你沒問題吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.38,0:24:05.14,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:08.72,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我來保護娜美桑！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:12.34,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,就算賭上我的命！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:15.16,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好的，謝謝。快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:20.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你既然願意拼命，那就替我們所有人當誘餌吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:22.34,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,只限女士啊，你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:25.46,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,自己顧好自己吧，花花公子！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:34.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,索隆君會盡力保護我的，別擔心！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:37.90,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,等等，騙人布！我受傷了...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.62,0:24:41.32,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不用擔心！我來掩護你！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.70,0:24:44.32,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你的傷也還沒痊癒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.62,0:24:51.04,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,說實話，在Thriller Bark上我看到了你的犧牲！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:52.76,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,原來如此...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:54.14,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,謝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.62,0:24:56.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們從那邊跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:57.24,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:24:59.16,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那些光束好恐怖！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:01.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,大家，三天後在千陽號集合！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:03.86,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,他們分散逃跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.90,0:25:05.34,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,追上去PX-1！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.00,0:25:09.28,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,別讓他們跑出12號紅樹林，不然就麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:12.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺超級煙霧星！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.36,0:25:17.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在是機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.36,0:25:19.76,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你真的很可靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.24,0:25:23.66,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡！橋！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:25.82,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:29.50,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他為什麼跑到這邊來了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:31.54,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂喂... 你...！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:33.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別推我！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:36.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他往那邊去了？他們沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.48,0:25:40.90,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你現在沒空擔心別人！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.02,0:25:44.12,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,不過我對海賊可沒什麼恨意。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.26,0:25:46.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:48.72,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}機關槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:52.16,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.12,0:25:54.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他剛才做了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:57.00,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你的攻擊力是不錯，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:59.92,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我的防禦可是全世界最強的！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.15,0:26:02.15,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}足鎖·吆嗨嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:03.98,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:06.06,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,什麼？！他竟然也這麼強？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.32,0:26:10.68,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,順帶告訴你，我不是惡魔果實能力者！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:14.52,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他的招式有什麼不對勁...！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.96,0:26:28.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什、什麼？！你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.66,0:26:30.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你... 走開！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:32.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你這怪胎給我離索隆遠一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.64,0:26:34.10,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,索、索、索隆先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.40,0:26:36.84,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,索隆先生被光束打中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.38,0:26:39.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂索隆，振作起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.40,0:26:42.22,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,真是的，他遲到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.80,0:26:44.96,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你終於來了嗎老頭黃猿？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.04,0:26:46.88,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,黃猿？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:50.40,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,小心！那個人是海軍大將！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:53.50,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,大將？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:26:58.14,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢，你來得有點晚了...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:27:04.24,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,懸賞金1億2000萬，「海賊獵人」索隆...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.94,0:27:08.70,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我聽說你是個相當不錯的劍士...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:14.86,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,但看你被一擊打倒了，看來是累壞了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.24,0:27:17.12,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,可惡...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:20.32,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他是大將...？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:24.26,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,好好休息吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.70,0:27:28.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.68,0:27:41.92,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，他也能發射光束！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.04,0:27:43.98,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,糟了！我們得想辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:46.70,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這麼近的距離被打中的話會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:50.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,糟糕了！索隆有危險了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:28:00.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.04,0:28:04.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你... 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:11.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.72,0:28:12.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我打不中他！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.34,0:28:19.82,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我也刺不中他！怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.92,0:28:21.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.94,0:28:23.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,把腳移開！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:29.74,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,拜託你移開！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.02,0:28:31.56,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,沒用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.18,0:28:35.18,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我吃了閃閃果實，我是光人。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.34,0:28:37.58,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我是自然系。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.70,0:28:38.92,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,光人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.58,0:28:41.86,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你開什麼玩笑？！他要死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.20,0:28:44.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,索隆！快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:47.32,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:52.82,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我的身體... 動不了...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:56.46,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒用了！那傢伙已經到極限了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:58.14,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二十輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:58.14,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}二十朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.16,0:29:05.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好！太好了羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:21.94,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我不會讓你逃掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:24.58,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,沒用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.50,0:29:32.36,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你要死在這裡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.88,0:29:50.50,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,到現在才出現嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:53.44,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,「冥王」雷利？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.44,0:29:56.61,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,我不會讓你對這些年輕人出手的。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.61,0:30:00.21,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,他們的時代才剛開始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:03.85,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,老爺子！

